    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>Best Zapier Alternatives in 2026</h1>
      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 5 alternatives · Business Tools Pillar · Automation Category</div>

      <p>Zapier pioneered no-code automation, but its per-task pricing model gets expensive fast — a team running 50 active Zaps with multi-step workflows can pay $100–$300/month. In 2026, alternatives like Make, n8n, Pipedream, Integrately, and Microsoft Power Automate offer better value, deeper customization, or self-hosted control. We ranked them on workflow builder quality, app directory, pricing model, and real-world scalability.</p>
      <p>For a direct head-to-head, see our <a href="/reviews/zapier-vs-make/">Zapier vs Make comparison</a>. Explore the <a href="/reviews/business-tools/">Business Tools Pillar</a> for CRM, email marketing, and productivity tool reviews.</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-overall-make">#1 — Make (Best Overall Zapier Alternative)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-selfhosted-n8n">#2 — n8n (Best Self-Hosted / Open-Source)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-developers-pipedream">#3 — Pipedream (Best for Developers & APIs)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-simplicity-integrately">#4 — Integrately (Best for Simplicity & Value)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-microsoft-power-automate">#5 — Microsoft Power Automate (Best for Microsoft 365)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#selection-scenarios">Selection Scenarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buying-guide">Buying Guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <h2 id="quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
